    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25292" root="صيب" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيُوبٌ</span></b>  An arrow <i>going right,</i> or <i>hitting the
mark:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُيُبٌ</span> (M, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِيَابٌ</span>, (MF, TA,)
or the latter is pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَائِبٌ</span>, which signifies the
same. (M, in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صوب</span>.)

